message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "portfolio-wave-rider: an AI agent that curates a watchlist from a news feed while a mechanical optimizer sizes it"
abstract: >-
  A research project in automated decisioning. A deterministic retriever gathers a
  date-stamped pool of news articles, an LLM curator reads that pool against a
  user-authored thesis and decides which tickers enter and leave the watchlist,
  citing the articles behind every change, and a standard mean-variance optimizer
  then sets the portfolio weights from trailing returns and covariances. The LLM
  never forecasts a return and never sizes a position, so every number is auditable
  and reproducible from code. Dual-licensed: the public writeup and the published
  dashboards under CC BY 4.0, the software and internal documentation under
  PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0.
type: software
